For using MUMPS with DKE,


1) first run the dsimpletest program in the test directory. If OK jump to 2)
2) cd to directory dke (in MUMPS_4.6.1)
3) type make Makefile mumpsdke
4) check dkeparam.m that the path is OK
5) should be OK in principle

REMARK: the routine MUMPS_dke_yp.m which makes the link between MatLab and DKE 
must be modified according to your specific operating environment.
